font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْغُرُورُ ، التَّسْبِيحُ (Dhoka, Tasbeeh) → الْغُرُورُ ، التَّسْبِيحُ ، التَّصْدِيقُ ، الْفُرْقَانُ (Dhoka, Paaki bayaan karna, Sach maanna, Furqan).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 28–29):** Pehle 8 asbaaq mein aapne 288 buniyadi Qur'ani alfaaz seekh liye hain jo Qur'an Majeed ke har safhe par baar-baar aate hain.",
