    {
      "id": "sec_s1l8_r3",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Yeh kitaab iss andaaz mein tayyar ki gayi hai ke mein Sha' Allah aahista aahista aap Al-Hamd (اَلْحَمْد) se ek-Naas (وَالنَّاس) tak poora Quran samajhne ke qabil ho jayenge!",
        "content": "Yeh kitaab iss andaaz mein tayyar ki gayi hai ke mein Sha' Allah aahista aahista aap Al-Hamd (اَلْحَمْد) se ek-Naas (وَالنَّاس) tak poora Quran samajhne ke qabil ho jayenge!",
        "hinglish_text": "Yeh kitaab iss andaaz mein tayyar ki gayi hai ke mein Sha' Allah aahista aahista aap Al-Hamd (اَلْحَمْد) se ek-Naas (وَالنَّاس) tak poora Quran samajhne ke qabil ho jayenge!"
