      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Alfaaz jaise (الشَّمْسُ, النَّارُ, السَّمَاءُ, الْأَرْضُ, جَهَنَّمُ) ke aakhir mein [ة] nahi hai, lekin Ahle Arab inhein Mu'annath (feminine) maante hain.",
        "content": "Alfaaz jaise (الشَّمْسُ, النَّارُ, السَّمَاءُ, الْأَرْضُ, جَهَنَّمُ) ke aakhir mein [ة] nahi hai, lekin Ahle Arab inhein Mu'annath (feminine) maante hain.",
        "hinglish_text": "Alfaaz jaise (الشَّمْسُ, النَّارُ, السَّمَاءُ, الْأَرْضُ, جَهَنَّمُ) ke aakhir mein [ة] nahi hai, lekin Ahle Arab inhein Mu'annath (feminine) maante hain."
